<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>高级字幕编辑器 on Aegisub</title><link>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/</link><description>Recent content in 高级字幕编辑器 on Aegisub</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2020 08:47:36 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Aegisub 开发者博客</title><link>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/blog/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/blog/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Privacy Policy</title><link>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/privacy-policy/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2020 19:23:18 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/privacy-policy/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="full-disclosure-statistics-collected-by-the-update-checker"&gt;Full disclosure: Statistics collected by the update checker &lt;a href="#full-disclosure-statistics-collected-by-the-update-checker" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are aware that some of our users care a lot about their privacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First, the short version: If you do not want to participate in anonymous data collection, do not enable the built-in update checker. If you want to know what information is collected, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aegisub&amp;rsquo;s update checker function retrieves a file describing any potential updates available for your installed version of Aegisub. Along with this request, some anonymous information about your operating environment are sent, to allow us as developers to better target our efforts, and to loosely gauge how large the Aegisub user base is.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>下载</title><link>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/downloads/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aegisub.org/zh-cn/downloads/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/TypesettingTools/Aegisub/releases/latest"&gt;最新的版本&lt;/a&gt;是 &lt;strong&gt;3.5.0&lt;/strong&gt;，发布于 2026年10月4日&lt;/p&gt;
